{"entities":"[{\"text\": \"lithium\", \"id\": \"D008094\", \"label\": \"Chemical\"}, {\"text\": \"hyperparathyroidism\", \"id\": \"D006961\", \"label\": \"Disease\"}, {\"text\": \"lithium\", \"id\": \"D008094\", \"label\": \"Chemical\"}, {\"text\": \"calcium\", \"id\": \"D002118\", \"label\": \"Chemical\"}, {\"text\": \"lithium\", \"id\": \"D008094\", \"label\": \"Chemical\"}, {\"text\": \"hypercalcemia\", \"id\": \"D006934\", \"label\": \"Disease\"}, {\"text\": \"Primary hyperparathyroidism\", \"id\": \"D049950\", \"label\": \"Disease\"}, {\"text\": \"lithium\", \"id\": \"D008094\", \"label\": \"Chemical\"}, {\"text\": \"lithium\", \"id\": \"D008094\", \"label\": \"Chemical\"}, {\"text\": \"hypercalcemic\", \"id\": \"D006934\", \"label\": \"Disease\"}, {\"text\": \"calcium\", \"id\": \"D002118\", \"label\": \"Chemical\"}]","filtered_entities":[{"text":"lithium","id":"D008094","label":"Chemical"},{"text":"hyperparathyroidism","id":"D006961","label":"Disease"},{"text":"calcium","id":"D002118","label":"Chemical"},{"text":"hypercalcemia","id":"D006934","label":"Disease"},{"text":"Primary hyperparathyroidism","id":"D049950","label":"Disease"}],"head":"calcium","head_id":"D002118","pairs":[{"head":"lithium","tail":"hyperparathyroidism","head_id":"D008094","tail_id":"D006961"},{"head":"lithium","tail":"hypercalcemia","head_id":"D008094","tail_id":"D006934"},{"head":"lithium","tail":"Primary hyperparathyroidism","head_id":"D008094","tail_id":"D049950"},{"head":"calcium","tail":"hyperparathyroidism","head_id":"D002118","tail_id":"D006961"},{"head":"calcium","tail":"hypercalcemia","head_id":"D002118","tail_id":"D006934"},{"head":"calcium","tail":"Primary hyperparathyroidism","head_id":"D002118","tail_id":"D049950"}],"relations":["D008094 | D006961","D008094 | D006934","D008094 | D049950"],"result":"~","tail":"Primary hyperparathyroidism","tail_id":"D049950","text":"Long-term lithium therapy leading to hyperparathyroidism: a case report. PURPOSE: This paper reviews the effect of chronic lithium therapy on serum calcium level and parathyroid glands, its pathogenesis, and treatment options. We examined the case of a lithium-treated patient who had recurrent hypercalcemia to better understand the disease process. CONCLUSION: Primary hyperparathyroidism is a rare but potentially life-threatening side effect of long-term lithium therapy. Careful patient selection and long-term follow-up can reduce morbidity. PRACTICAL IMPLICATIONS: As much as 15% of lithium-treated patients become hypercalcemic. By routinely monitoring serum calcium levels, healthcare providers can improve the quality of life of this patient group.","metrics":{"precision":0.6666666666666666,"recall":1.0,"f1":0.8,"rel_tp":2,"rel_fp":1,"rel_fn":0}}